-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled assets
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
model/motionbricks_mlx/assets/g1_model_rig.npz and soma_model_rig.npz are copied
unchanged from upstream tools/onnx/assets/. NVIDIA's contributions to these rig
assets are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (upstream LICENSE,
section "NVIDIA RIG ASSETS").

model/motionbricks_mlx/assets/checkpoints.sha256 lists the released checkpoint
files with their sizes and SHA-256 digests, copied from upstream
tools/onnx/checksums.py (Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES,
Apache-2.0). It is used to verify downloads; it contains no weights.

model/motionbricks_mlx/assets/clips.sha256 lists four upstream sample clips with the
sizes and SHA-256 digests of their Git LFS pointers. It is used to verify downloads;
it contains no motion data.

